Sources/ImmichAPI/openapi.json is the Immich API specification from the Immich
project (https://github.com/immich-app/immich), licensed under AGPL-3.0. It is
included only to generate the API client. "Immich" is a name of the Immich
project; Bloom is an independent client and is not affiliated with it.
